==Trivia==
The standard print of this card is part of a narrative illustration with {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Pidgeotto|187}} and {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Pidgeot|188}} from the same set. In this illustration, one Pidgey can be seen perching on a tree branch while another Pidgey approaches. All three cards are illustrated by [[Scav]] and form the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Pidgey Squad" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pidgey}}.
*{{m|Gust}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pidgey}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

